  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Solar (PV) and wind energy projects of 10,000 to 40,000 &#x20ac; each. EKOenergy will want to see how the community are involved and how the project will be sustainable and be replicated in the near future, and how it will be communicated locally (ie will communities set aside some money? Will there be a kind of revolving fund? What else will be done or tried?).</narrative>
